# Pokémon FireRed, from a starting save made in the player's bedroom.
# FRAME KEYS: press at FRAME, release 6 frames later. The kernel launches
# the game by frame 200.

# Skip the intro, pass the title screen, choose CONTINUE.
600 A
720 A
840 A
960 A
1080 A

# START menu: BAG, <player>, SAVE. Save, and overwrite the existing file.
1400 START
1460 DOWN
1500 DOWN
1540 A
1700 A
2100 A

# Saving takes about 500 frames; then close the message. B, because A would
# talk to the NES the player faces.
2600 B
2900 -
